 "_doc": "Maquassi Hills LM (Wolmaransstad). Bilingual one-page ledger: 'TAX INVOICE <biller VAT> <account> <yyyymmdd>' then DATUM / DOK Nr / BESKRYWING / BEDRAG lines (yy/mm/dd), '*' marks vatable lines, followed by 'VALUE ADDED TAX INCLUDED <vat>' and TOTAL AMOUNT PAYABLE. EVERY AMOUNT IS VAT-INCLUSIVE (proof: 15/115 of the starred lines equals the printed VAT within 1c) and no ex-VAT figure, rate or per-line VAT is printed; the engine has no divide/constant op, so total_ex_vat_r and the Rand columns are deliberately BLANK. The VAT-inclusive electricity figures are kept natively: mq_kwh_incl_r ('KVA<meter> INDUSTRIAL KVA CHARGE' + PREV/CURR/CONS kWh line), mq_kva_incl_r ('KVAS<meter> INDUSTRIAL KVA CHARGE' + kVA CONS) and mq_basic_incl_r, summed in mq_elec_incl_r. Readings, kWh, kVA, meter, tariff (INDUSTRIAL), deposits are filled. Fingerprint: the biller VAT number on the TAX INVOICE line + 'MAQUASSI HILLS'. CHECK mq_ledger_identity_r = balance b/f + receipts + all current lines vs printed total payable: within 0.05 (bill rounds to 5c) on 10/10. No identity for ex-VAT possible.",
